EXHAUSTION CONFLUENCE — does a count near a signal change anything?
59 symbols · 333 days · 15m+30m+1h
9118 sent, 2909 picked

MOMENTUM = the 9-bar setup.  TERMINAL = the 13-bar countdown.
'control' is the SAME test against the OPPOSITE direction. If the
control moves as much as the signal, the mechanism is not
exhaustion — it is whatever both directions share.
* marks |z| >= 2. Sixteen looks are taken, so roughly one will
clear by chance; the control and the two halves are what separate a
finding from a coincidence.

